Sridevi Women’s Engineering College is a women’s engineering college located in Hyderabad, Telangana.
It offers undergraduate and postgraduate courses in various engineering and technology fields.
The college focuses on providing quality technical education and practical skills to students.
It encourages students to participate in academic, cultural, and extracurricular activities.
The college aims to empower women through education and prepare them for successful careers.


